{"kind":"stack","id":"s-sun-earth-moon","title":"The sun, Earth and moon are round","theme":{"background":"#fdf6e3","foreground":"#1d2b3a","font":"Comic Sans MS, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"globe"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-q","content":"What shape is the Earth?"},{"type":"button","id":"c1-a","label":"Flat like a plate","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Round like a ball","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c1-c","label":"Square like a box","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"Which of these is closest to a sphere?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"A cube of ice","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"A bouncy ball","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"A flat pancake","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-t","content":"Sphere"},{"type":"text","id":"c3-e","content":"A ball shape. Every point on its surface is the same distance from the centre."},{"type":"button","id":"c3-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"moon"},{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"What shape is the moon?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Flat like a coin","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Like a long tube","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Roughly round like a ball","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"sun"},{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"What shape is the sun?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Round like a ball","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Like a star with points","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"Like a triangle","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"Approximately spherical"},{"type":"text","id":"c6-e","content":"Almost a perfect ball shape. Big objects in space are pulled into a round shape by their own gravity."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-n","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"ship"},{"type":"text","id":"c7-q","content":"Your ship sails to a new planet. Which way do you explore?"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a","label":"Walk the whole planet in a straight line","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Keep sailing and you come back to where you started","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-c","label":"You fall off the edge","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"You are an astronaut. Your rocket is low on fuel. Do you turn towards the round moon or the bright sun?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"Head for the round moon","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Head for the bright sun","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-t","content":"You land softly on the moon. Its round surface looks like a giant ball from up close."},{"type":"button","id":"c9-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-t","content":"You fly towards the sun. Its glowing ball shape shines brightly. You turn back safely to Earth."},{"type":"button","id":"c10-n","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"Well done! You finished the round-shapes quiz."},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"The sun, Earth and moon are all almost perfect balls. Keep looking up and wondering why!"}],"actions":[]}}
